I guess even Reigen-san is
pessimistic about these matters.

00:12:59.153 --> 00:13:02.699
He seems really popular with our clients
who are older ladies, though...

00:13:04.117 --> 00:13:05.368
However...

00:13:05.576 --> 00:13:06.828
...Mob is different.

00:13:07.036 --> 00:13:09.956
He should follow the straight and narrow.

00:13:10.164 --> 00:13:12.875
He shouldn't bother with lies.

00:13:17.922 --> 00:13:20.591
You've got this, Mob.

00:13:33.813 --> 00:13:36.858
What's with all the sighing, friend?

00:13:37.066 --> 00:13:38.943
Are you in trouble again?

00:13:39.152 --> 00:13:40.903
Hanazawa-kun.

00:13:42.780 --> 00:13:45.742
Huh. So your childhood
friend is transferring.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:49.454
Yeah. I haven't had the chance to
actually talk to her these past few years,

00:13:49.662 --> 00:13:51.414
and this was really sudden.

00:13:51.622 --> 00:13:54.709
So that's why you're in
a hurry to ask her out.

00:13:54.917 --> 00:13:56.085
Yeah.

00:13:56.294 --> 00:13:59.756
But this is my first time,
so it's been pretty difficult.

00:13:59.964 --> 00:14:02.884
It's really not something
to be that scared of.

00:14:03.092 --> 00:14:05.511
It must be nice being you,
Hanazawa-kun, since you're popular.

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.972
You're nothing like me.

00:14:08.181 --> 00:14:09.974
What are you talking about?

00:14:10.183 --> 00:14:13.978
You're the one who said we
were alike in the first place.

00:14:14.187 --> 00:14:18.608
Go on. Relax those shoulders.
Smile and stand proud.

00:14:18.816 --> 00:14:23.905
You need to be more confident!
It's not like you're doing anything bad.

00:14:24.113 --> 00:14:27.492
Are you thinking about
getting something for her?

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.535
That thought hadn't even crossed my mind.

00:14:29.744 --> 00:14:33.081
I see... A gift, huh?

00:14:33.289 --> 00:14:35.792
I'm usually the one getting asked out,

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:40.254
but when I get letters or homemade cookies,
it does make me pretty happy.

00:14:40.463 --> 00:14:42.590
I figured that might be an option.

00:14:42.799 --> 00:14:44.425
Homemade...

00:14:45.718 --> 00:14:48.429
That's not gonna work.
I only know how to make rice balls.

00:14:48.638 --> 00:14:50.973
Hey, you don't need to push yourself.

00:14:51.182 --> 00:14:55.603
There's no guarantee that
it's better to give her something.

00:14:55.812 --> 00:15:00.733
Actually, in your case, maybe you can get
her some flowers, even if it's a bit cliché.

00:15:00.942 --> 00:15:02.902
I'm sure it couldn't hurt.

00:15:04.028 --> 00:15:05.780
Flowers...

00:15:05.988 --> 00:15:08.866
Also, I'll gladly pick out
your clothes for you.

00:15:09.075 --> 00:15:13.913
I-I don't actually have enough money
to buy any clothes, so I'll pass this time.

00:15:14.122 --> 00:15:15.706
Thanks, though.

00:15:18.668 --> 00:15:22.130
Nii-san. About Takane-san moving...

00:15:22.338 --> 00:15:25.383
Oh, you already know, Ritsu?

00:15:26.759 --> 00:15:28.136
I see.

00:15:28.344 --> 00:15:31.097
So you're also going to
ask her out, after all.

00:15:31.305 --> 00:15:33.391
The time's finally arrived.

00:15:33.599 --> 00:15:37.395
I'm honestly really nervous
just thinking about it.

00:15:37.603 --> 00:15:40.148
How is she going to respond?

00:15:41.691 --> 00:15:44.318
I'm pretty sure I remember Takane-san
saying she likes someone...

00:15:44.318 --> 00:15:47.363
"Spirits and Such Consultation Office" I'm pretty
sure I remember Takane-san saying she likes someone...

00:15:47.363 --> 00:15:47.488
"Spirits and Such Consultation Office"

00:15:47.572 --> 00:15:50.783
Yes. The person I like is someone from
another school I met at cram school.

00:15:50.992 --> 00:15:55.913
From what you've told me, the other person
is obviously interested in you as well.

00:15:56.122 --> 00:15:59.250
If you ask them out, there's a very
good possibility they'll say yes.

00:15:59.459 --> 00:16:01.085
It's over...

00:16:02.295 --> 00:16:06.966
Anyway, I hope she doesn't
turn him down too harshly.

00:16:07.175 --> 00:16:08.176
Ritsu...

00:16:08.384 --> 00:16:12.263
He's probably more worried
about me than I am.

00:16:12.472 --> 00:16:16.184
I'm not sure why, but it
somehow calms me down.

00:16:16.392 --> 00:16:19.187
Thanks, Ritsu.
I'll give it everything I've got.

00:16:19.395 --> 00:16:20.605
Nii-san...

00:16:21.606 --> 00:16:23.941
Don't lose heart too much, okay?

00:16:27.445 --> 00:16:29.197
"Every Morning Milk"
"Enjoy a glass a day!!"

00:16:39.749 --> 00:16:41.834
"Phone Numbers"

00:16:42.210 --> 00:16:43.336
"Takashio Takayama
Takane Tanaka"

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:05.650
H-Hello?

00:17:05.858 --> 00:17:10.154
I-It's been a while, ma'am.
It's me, Shigeo.

00:17:10.363 --> 00:17:12.323
Is Tsubomi-chan available?

00:17:12.532 --> 00:17:15.868
Y-Yes. Thank you very much.

00:17:21.249 --> 00:17:24.252
H-Hello, Tsubomi-chan?

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:29.423
S-Sorry to call you out of the blue.
I only know your house phone.

00:17:29.632 --> 00:17:32.635
So, uh, I heard...

00:17:32.843 --> 00:17:36.097
Um... Like...

00:17:36.305 --> 00:17:38.558
...that you're moving away.

00:17:38.766 --> 00:17:41.727
Oh... So it's true.

00:17:41.936 --> 00:17:43.521
Right, of course.

00:17:43.729 --> 00:17:49.110
Yeah, so, hey... There's something
I wanted to talk to you about.

00:17:49.318 --> 00:17:52.488
Huh? It's a bit awkward
to say on the phone.

00:17:52.697 --> 00:17:56.576
I was wondering if you had
some time after school tomorrow...

00:17:56.784 --> 00:17:59.328
No, it's better if we meet
somewhere other than school.

00:17:59.537 --> 00:18:04.292
Since we live so close to each other,
why don't we just go to the park?

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:08.087
Yeah. The one we used
to play at all the time.

00:18:08.296 --> 00:18:11.299
Hm? I'm acting weird?

00:18:11.507 --> 00:18:16.095
Really? My voice? No, it's not shaky...

00:18:16.304 --> 00:18:18.848
Yeah... You're totally imagining it.

00:18:19.056 --> 00:18:21.642
Yeah, uh-huh.

00:18:21.851 --> 00:18:23.728
Yeah, that's fine.

00:18:23.936 --> 00:18:25.605
Sure.

00:18:37.283 --> 00:18:40.745
What? You made plans with her? Way to go!

00:18:40.953 --> 00:18:42.705
And instead of behind the school,

00:18:42.913 --> 00:18:46.334
you chose a nostalgic park for
the both of you. Chef's kiss.

00:18:46.542 --> 00:18:48.002
I didn't know you had it in you, man!

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:49.503
If you end up going out with her,

00:18:49.712 --> 00:18:52.548
introduce me to one of
Takane-san's girl friends.

00:18:52.757 --> 00:18:54.842
--Sure.
--Heck yeah!

00:18:56.636 --> 00:18:57.970
Now, then...

00:18:58.179 --> 00:19:02.266
The point where line A
and line B intersect is -2.

00:19:02.475 --> 00:19:04.310
--I wonder what it is...
--This will be on the test.

00:19:04.518 --> 00:19:07.855
Despite knowing I'm going to have a really
important conversation with Tsubomi-chan,

00:19:08.064 --> 00:19:10.107
I'm surprisingly calm.

00:19:12.735 --> 00:19:13.944
Come to think of it,

00:19:14.153 --> 00:19:20.034
I wonder why I thought to ask everyone
for advice about asking her out.

00:19:25.623 --> 00:19:28.042
I think lately...

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.961
...I'm not holding in
my feelings as much.

00:19:39.053 --> 00:19:42.807
"Seasoning Realty"

00:19:43.015 --> 00:19:43.140
"Smiley Flowers"

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:46.185
"Smiley Flowers"
I'd like an assorted bouquet... please.

00:19:46.185 --> 00:19:46.394
"Smiley Flowers"

00:19:46.394 --> 00:19:49.730
"Smiley Flowers"
Sure. Do you need a bag?

00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:49.814
Sure. Do you need a bag?

00:19:50.022 --> 00:19:52.358
Does this work for you?

00:19:52.566 --> 00:19:53.442
Yes.

00:19:53.651 --> 00:19:56.779
I guess they're really small at 1,000 yen.

00:19:56.987 --> 00:19:59.740
It's not about size anyway.

00:19:59.949 --> 00:20:02.076
Thank you very much!

00:20:06.622 --> 00:20:08.207
Kageyama Shigeo.

00:20:10.876 --> 00:20:13.671
Um, you're...

00:20:15.256 --> 00:20:16.674
Trade me.

00:20:16.882 --> 00:20:17.633
Huh?!

00:20:17.633 --> 00:20:17.800
"Seasoning Realty"
Huh?!

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:18.008
"Seasoning Realty"

00:20:18.008 --> 00:20:20.094
"Seasoning Realty"
Are you sure? But why...?

00:20:20.094 --> 00:20:20.302
"Seasoning Realty"

00:20:20.302 --> 00:20:21.595
"Seasoning Realty"
Yeah, just come on.

00:20:21.595 --> 00:20:22.138
Yeah, just come on.

00:20:31.021 --> 00:20:33.065
Everyone...

00:20:33.274 --> 00:20:34.817
Thank you.

00:21:55.314 --> 00:21:57.525
There was a blue light shining

00:21:57.733 --> 00:21:59.985
I'm wide awake this 1:30 AM

00:22:00.194 --> 00:22:02.613
What remained even after I swiped

00:22:02.822 --> 00:22:06.450
Are the smiles of my friends right beside me

00:22:15.459 --> 00:22:17.670
Yes, I want someone to understand...

00:22:17.878 --> 00:22:20.214
This wish that's hidden colorless and invisible

00:22:20.422 --> 00:22:22.758
The breath I was holding deep within my heart

00:22:22.967 --> 00:22:25.427
I let it all out at once and return to my senses

00:22:25.636 --> 00:22:27.805
On days that I'm feeling apathetic
it suddenly comes to mind

00:22:28.013 --> 00:22:30.349
These seasons I spent as if they were a given

00:22:30.558 --> 00:22:32.852
Even if reality becomes sullied

00:22:33.060 --> 00:22:36.105
Only the sky we saw together is real

00:22:36.313 --> 00:22:38.232
This is more incomprehensible

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:40.484
Than the grammar on the blackboard

00:22:40.693 --> 00:22:42.903
If it's going to disappear within 24 hours

00:22:43.112 --> 00:22:45.781
This flowing story is just too lonely

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:47.700
I just can't do it

00:22:47.908 --> 00:22:49.910
Just like that back hip circle I gave up on

00:22:50.119 --> 00:22:52.413
But I'm not going to...

00:22:52.621 --> 00:22:53.956
Give up

00:22:54.164 --> 00:22:55.749
My present anymore

00:22:55.958 --> 00:22:58.168
I adorn my overflowing emotions

00:22:58.377 --> 00:23:00.713
And run through my worries and hesitations

00:23:00.921 --> 00:23:03.215
It can't be decided from 0 to 100

00:23:03.424 --> 00:23:05.759
Draw the incomplete future with this hand

00:23:05.968 --> 00:23:08.220
We can't even prove its existence

00:23:08.429 --> 00:23:11.390
But as the world stabs the middle of my chest

00:23:11.599 --> 00:23:14.727
It overflows with cobalt blue

00:23:23.277 --> 00:23:25.029
English Translator: Michelle Tymon Translation Editor:
Zachary Carlysle Translation Checker: Sriram Gurunathan

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:30.618
Kageyama-kun, I know that you're
trying to accept your powers.

00:23:30.826 --> 00:23:31.952
You've worked so hard.

00:23:32.161 --> 00:23:34.288
And that's why you shouldn't go any further.

00:23:34.496 --> 00:23:35.623
Turn back now.

00:23:35.831 --> 00:23:37.666
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 Il Episode 10:

00:23:37.666 --> 00:23:38.125
"Mob 2 ~Rival~" Next time on
Mob Psycho 1700 Ill Episode 10:

00:23:38.125 --> 00:23:38.334
"Mob 2
~Rival~"

00:23:38.334 --> 00:23:40.002
"Mob 2 ~Rival~" "Mob 2 ~Rival~."